  m_Name: Commando
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SurvivorData
  SurvivorName: Commando
  Description: Boasts well-rounded stats, high attack speed, and long range, making
    him highly efficient even with minimal items. However, his health scaling per
    level is tied with Huntress for the lowest among all survivors. Bolster your
    survivability with items and time your dodges and Full Metal Jacket properly
    to greatly increase your chances of survival.
